~ start
$>  Global.expression = "normal"
Christine: hi 
if Global.chr_meter < Global.ONE_HEART:
	=> one_heart

~ one_heart
%
	Christine: ...
	Christine: how are you?
	- good
		Christine: mhmm [$> Global.chr_meter -= 2][$> Global.happiness -= 2][$> Global.wrong += 1]
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Christine: that's good [$> Global.expression = "normal"]
		=>< questions

	- today's been really tiring
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Christine: I know right [$> Global.chr_meter += 2][$> Global.happiness += 2]
		Christine: I feel like I'm struggling to keep my eyes open
		Christine: and I got six hours of sleep last night, that's pretty good right?
		- yea, I got around that much too
			$> Global.expression = "laugh"
			Christine: yes, you get it! [$> Global.chr_meter += 2][$> Global.happiness += 2]
			$> Global.expression = "normal"
		- six?!
			$> Global.expression = "sad"
			Christine: ohh... I guess it is bad... [$> Global.chr_meter -= 2][$> Global.happiness -= 2][$> Global.wrong += 1]
		Christine: I really wish we could just sleep right now...
		- I mean, we could? 
			$> Global.chr_meter -= 2 
			$> Global.happiness += 2
			$> Global.wrong += 1
			$> Global.expression = "normal"
			Christine: oh, yea, that's true...
			$> Global.expression = "happy"
			Christine: but no - we have to lock in! 
			Christine: ok, let's keep talking after class
		- right, me too 
			$> Global.expression = "laugh"
			Christine: pfft [$> Global.chr_meter += 2][$> Global.happiness -= 2]
			$> Global.expression = "happy"
			Christine: let's take a nap at lunch then! 
			=>< questions
% 
	Christine: ...
	Christine: were you able to write down the last slide? 
	- no
		Christine: me neither [$> Global.chr_meter += 4][$> Global.happiness += 2]
		Christine: miss, can you go back one slide please
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Christine: thank you so much!
		- damn, you did that so casually
			$> Global.expression = "normal"
			Christine: huh, did what?
			- oh nevermind haha... 
				$> Global.expression = "angry"
				Christine: [$> Global.chr_meter -= 4][$> Global.happiness -= 2] oh, ok...
			- like, 
				Christine: ...
				- asking to go back a slide
					Christine: ...
					- I don't think I could do that haha
						Christine: [$> Global.chr_meter += 2][$> Global.happiness += 2] huh?
						Christine: ohh, do you feel awkward like, asking for help? 
						$> Global.expression = "laugh"
						Christine: you're just like Farah haha!
						$> Global.expression = "happy"
						Christine: don't worry, I'll train you too
						- train me?
							Christine: [$> Global.chr_meter += 2]like, give you the push to ask questions in class
							Christine: it's what I do with Farah 
							$> Global.expression = "laugh"
							Christine: I got her from asking no questions to asking one like, 30% of the times she needs to
							$> Global.expression = "happy"
							Christine: which is some progress!
							$> Global.expression = "laugh"
							Christine: so yea, I'll help you too haha
						- ok, thanks haha
							Christine: [$> Global.chr_meter -= 2][$> Global.happiness -= 2] no problem
		- thanks
			$> Global.expression = "happy"
			Christine: [$> Global.happiness -= 2] no problem
			$> Global.expression = "normal"
			Christine: I mean, I needed it too
	- most of it
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Christine: [$> Global.chr_meter += 2][$> Global.happiness -= 2]oh cool! can I write it down from your book
		$> Global.expression = "normal"
		Christine: I missed it... haha
	=> questions
=> END

~ questions
$> Global.expression = "normal"
Christine: ...
- compliment
	% => good
	%2 => bad
- joke 
	% => joke_good
	% => joke_bad
- open up [if Global.chr_meter > Global.FOUR_HEARTS]
- end convo
=> END

~ good
Christine: ...  [$> Global.chr_meter += 4][$> Global.happiness += 2]
$> Global.expression = "happy"
Christine: you really think so? 
$> Global.expression = "laugh"
Christine: thank you! 
=> bell
=> END

~ bad
Christine: ... [$> Global.chr_meter -= 4][$> Global.happiness -= 4][$> Global.wrong += 1]
$> Global.expression = "angry"
Christine: ??
Christine: now's not time for you to joke around
=> bell
=> END

~ joke_good
Christine: ...
$> Global.expression = "laugh"
Christine: pfft [$> Global.chr_meter += 2][$> Global.happiness += 2]
Christine: that's so stupid haha
=> bell
=> END

~ joke_bad
Christine: ...
$> Global.expression = "normal"
Christine: hmm [$> Global.chr_meter -= 2][$> Global.happiness -= 2][$> Global.wrong += 1]
Christine: oh yea...
=> bell
=> END

~ bell
$> Global.expression = "happy"
Christine: ok, let's lock in now!
=> END